SPECIFICITY: SPECIFIC

1. The Strongman High Striker Revival - This implementation directly builds upon existing GDD specifications by recreating all game mechanics as described, including variables friction ("Rusty Rails"), weighted pucks, counter-weight springs, bell's curse, cracked base, echo strikes modifier, sabotaged mallet heads, shock plates, sound dampeners, tower gauge shift, and other features mentioned.
