### Mechanic: Echo Strikes rhythm
INTENT: tracks consecutive hits on the same spot to build tension and award streak bonuses
PSEUDO:
  if IsSensorTriggered(puck_sensor) then
    current_spot = GetPosition(puck_sensor)
